  "items": [
    {
      "source": "While it is possible for a <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> to declare that it throws arbitrary exception types, any checked\nexceptions thrown from a <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> are wrapped in an\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/UndeclaredThrowableException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>UndeclaredThrowableException</code></a> since the callback mechanism can\nonly handle runtime exceptions. Entity callback processing is stopped on the <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> that raised an\nexception and the caused exception is propagated to the caller.",
      "translation": "虽然 `<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a>` 可以声明抛出任意类型的异常，但任何从 `<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a>` 抛出的受检异常都会被包装在\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/UndeclaredThrowableException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>UndeclaredThrowableException</code></a> 中，因为回调机制只能处理运行时异常。当 `<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a>` 抛出异常时，实体回调处理将在此处停止，并引发的异常会传播给调用者。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "An <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> can generically declare the domain type that it is able to process by specifying the\ngeneric type parameter <code>&lt;T&gt;</code>. When registered with a Spring\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>, callbacks are filtered accordingly, with the callback getting\ninvoked for assignable domain objects only.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> 可以通过指定泛型类型参数 <code>&lt;T&gt;</code> 来泛化声明其能够处理的域类型。当将其注册到 Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 时，回调会根据此类型进行过滤，仅对可赋值给该类型的域对象触发回调。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Multiple entity callbacks are invoked sequentially with the result of the previous callback. Callbacks are unordered\nby default. It is possible to define the order in which listeners for a certain domain type are to be invoked. To do\nso, add Spring's common <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/annotation/Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>@Order</code></a> annotation or implement\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/Ordered.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Ordered</code></a>.",
      "translation": "多个实体回调按顺序依次调用，且前一个回调的结果会传递给下一个。默认情况下，回调是无序的。可以定义特定领域类型监听器的调用顺序：为此，请添加 Spring 通用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/annotation/Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>@Order</code></a> 注解，或实现 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/Ordered.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Ordered</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> interface needs to define a callback method accepting an object of the parameterized type as\nits first argument followed by additional <i>optional</i> arguments.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> 接口需要定义一个回调方法，该方法接受参数化类型的对象作为第一个参数，随后是额外的<i>可选</i>参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Typically, entity callbacks are invoked after publishing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>events</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通常情况下，实体回调会在发布<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>events</code></a>之后被调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
