    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - Entity type used to detect <a href=\"EntityCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>callbacks</code></a> to invoke via their generic type signature.</span></dd>",
